# Packaged evaluator evidence is generated from outputs and currently exceeds
# GitHub's regular-file limit (the archive is about 167 MB).  It is intentionally
# kept outside source Git; publish a verified archive as a release asset or with
# Git LFS if distribution is required.  Removing this rule risks making ordinary
# clones large or causing pushes to fail, while keeping it has no effect on code,
# tests, small scene assets, or reproducibility from the recorded manifests.
